    ☐ A remote reward's source check does not grant its vanilla prize or somebody else's local item. @critical
    ☐ Only the genuine EndGoal reports CLIENT_GOAL; reconnecting does not create a premature victory. @critical
    ☐ Save/restart both game and client during pending network delivery, reconnect, then finish remaining checks without loss/duplication. @critical

Tracker presentation and logic:
